      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786897823054,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Pre-compute top K for each time window (this is doable with tumbling\nwindow)\n- Adding cron job to our system, on fixed intervals, compute top K each\ntime window and warm up cache\n- Challenge: operational complexity, handle with cron job fails, monitor if we\nare far behind, constraint when we could serve stale data\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Pre-compute top K for each time window (this is doable with tumbling window)\n- Adding cron job to our system, on fixed intervals, compute top K each time window and warm up cache\n- Challenge: operational complexity, handle with cron job fails, monitor if we are far behind, constraint when we could serve stale data\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
