    {
      "id": "u4o7EaEgTg0aVCE3Lu5n0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 878,
      "y": 1110.5,
      "width": 628.00537109375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bvZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 633599897,
      "version": 727,
      "versionNonce": 1618864247,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786898159653,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Assume 70B views/day ==> 100k seconds/day = 700k tps\n- Modern RDMS handle ~10k writes/sec so that is a lot!\n- SHARDING INGESTION --> FOR CALING WRITE\n- Sharding based on EventId (videoID), consumer for that\npartition reads the view event from Kafka topic and fires off\nwrite to DB for that shard\n- Batching ingestion with FLINK, use\n`BoundedOutOfOrdernessWatermarkStrategy` to handle late\nevent, tell Flink we are ok to wait some time for late event to\narrvive, use tumbling window to aggregate 1 hr view\n- If host fails, Flink rewind to checkpoint offset in Kafka topic\nand resume processing from there\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Assume 70B views/day ==> 100k seconds/day = 700k tps\n- Modern RDMS handle ~10k writes/sec so that is a lot!\n- SHARDING INGESTION --> FOR CALING WRITE\n- Sharding based on EventId (videoID), consumer for that partition reads the view event from Kafka topic and fires off write to DB for that shard\n- Batching ingestion with FLINK, use `BoundedOutOfOrdernessWatermarkStrategy` to handle late event, tell Flink we are ok to wait some time for late event to arrvive, use tumbling window to aggregate 1 hr view\n- If host fails, Flink rewind to checkpoint offset in Kafka topic and resume processing from there\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
