      "originalText": "4) What if we need to support Sliding window",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sJXn9ZmJT9iVFRXMumztn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 876.3985522583637,
      "y": 2536.3144217103045,
      "width": 730.8329682946705,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bvg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227842231,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 2016095129,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786898790753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Flink jobs aggregate, at a minute grain, the views for each video.\n2) Whenever a new minute has passed and we're ready to write to our\ndatabase:\n- i) Read all of the views that happened in the minute exactly T-60\nminutes ago. Call this our decrement.\n- ii) Write all of the views that happened in the last minute (our\nincrement) to VideoViews.\n- iii) Update the VideoViewsLastHour table with difference between the\nincrement and decrement.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Flink jobs aggregate, at a minute grain, the views for each video.\n2) Whenever a new minute has passed and we're ready to write to our database:\n- i) Read all of the views that happened in the minute exactly T-60 minutes ago. Call this our decrement.\n- ii) Write all of the views that happened in the last minute (our increment) to VideoViews.\n- iii) Update the VideoViewsLastHour table with difference between the increment and decrement.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CPXbPDYo0ycU6dSM_qn1C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880.2673734285504,
      "y": 2767.798888393303,
      "width": 680.7879130715928,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
